SOURCELONG:Tome of Horrors Complete	SOURCESHORT:ToHC	SOURCEWEB:https://froggodgames.com	SOURCEDATE:2011-01

# Frog God Games monster feats the Tome of Horrors creatures take, read by both Tome of Horrors sources
Gaze to Ray			CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Monster	PREVARGTEQ:PreStatScore_INT,13	DESC:The creature can project its gaze attack as a ray of energy.	BENEFIT:The creature can project its gaze attack as a ray of energy to a range of 30 feet. This requires the creature to succeed at a ranged touch attack to affect an opponent. A creature hit by the ray suffers the effects just as if it had met the creature's gaze (if the gaze allows a save, the opponent gets its save to avoid its effects). After using this feat, the creature cannot use its gaze attack for 1d4 rounds and it is disoriented during this time (-2 penalty on attack rolls, saves, skill checks, and ability checks). Prerequisites: Int 13, gaze attack.
Improved Poison		CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Monster	PRETOTALAB:4	DESC:The creature's poison deals more damage.	BENEFIT:The damage (hit point or ability) for the creature's poison increases by one step using the following progression: 1, 1d2, 1d3, 1d4, 1d6, 1d8, 2d6, 2d8, 4d6, 6d6, 8d6, 12d6. Poisons that do not deal damage or drain are unaffected by this feat. Prerequisites: ability to deliver poison from a natural attack, base attack bonus +4.
Spirited Runner		CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Monster	PREVARGTEQ:PreStatScore_DEX,15	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Endurance	DESC:The creature can turn while running.	BENEFIT:When running, the creature can turn 90 degrees left or right. It costs 2 squares of movement in the space before the turn, the space the creature turns in, and the space after the turn; any movement left can be taken normally once the turn is completed. A creature can turn as many times as it wants so long as it can pay the movement cost. Creatures with a swim speed can use this feat when swimming if they take a run action. Normal: When running, the creature can normally only run in a straight line.
Swim-By Attack		CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Monster	PREMOVE:1,Swim=1	DESC:The creature can move before and after it makes an attack while swimming.	BENEFIT:When swimming, the creature can take a move action and another standard action at any point during the move. The creature cannot take a second move action during a round it makes a swim-by attack. Normal: Without this feat, the creature takes a standard action either before or after its move.
